msgid ""
"Welcome to RECALBOX for Odroid Go Advance!\n"
"This little presentation will show you how to use the 6 special buttons "
"available right under the screen.\n"
"\n"
"Press any button to start!"
msgstr ""
"Laipni lūdzam RECALBOX priekš Odroid Go Advance!\n"
"Šī īsā prezentācija parādīs, kā izmantot 6 īpašās pogas, kas atrodas tieši "
"zem ekrāna.\n"
"\n"
"Nospiediet jebkuru pogu, lai sāktu!"

msgid ""
"The leftmost button is the SELECT button, marked with a 'I', also available "
"on most modern pads.\n"
"But it is also the HOTKEY button that you can use in conjunction with other "
"buttons in most emulators.\n"
"For example, you can use HOTKEY+START to quit the current game.\n"
"\n"
"Press the SELECT button."
msgstr ""
"Kreisākā poga ir SELECT poga, apzīmēta ar 'I', pieejama arī lielākajā daļā "
"moderno pultu.\n"
"Bet tā ir arī HOTKEY poga, ko varat izmantot kopā ar citām pogām lielākajā "
"daļā emulatoru.\n"
"Piemēram, varat izmantot HOTKEY+START, lai izietu no pašreizējās spēles.\n"
"\n"
"Nospiediet SELECT pogu."

msgid ""
"Next to the SELECT button is the START button, marked with an 'II'.\n"
"Use it to open the main menu in the Recalbox interface and use it in-game as "
"the regular START button available on most consoles.\n"
"\n"
"Press this START button please."
msgstr ""
"Blakus SELECT pogai ir START poga, apzīmēta ar 'II'.\n"
"Izmantojiet to, lai atvērtu galveno izvēlni Recalbox saskarnē, un spēlē "
"izmantojiet to kā parasto START pogu, kas pieejama lielākajā daļā konsoļu.\n"
"\n"
"Lūdzu, nospiediet šo START pogu."

msgid ""
"Then, there are 2 buttons marked with a 'III' and a 'IV'.\n"
"Use them to raise or lower the volume at any time in the Recalbox interface "
"or in-game.\n"
"\n"
" Press either volume up or down (III/IV)."
msgstr ""
"Tad ir 2 pogas, apzīmētas ar 'III' un 'IV'.\n"
"Izmantojiet tās, lai jebkurā laikā palielinātu vai samazinātu skaļumu "
"Recalbox saskarnē vai spēlē.\n"
"\n"
" Nospiediet skaļuma palielināšanu vai samazināšanu (III/IV)."

msgid ""
"The last two buttons marked 'V' and 'VI' are useful to make your screen "
"darker or brighter.\n"
"Note that the brighter the screen, the more power it consumes!\n"
"\n"
" Press either brightness up or down (V/VI)."
msgstr ""
"Pēdējās divas pogas, apzīmētas ar 'V' un 'VI', ir noderīgas, lai padarītu "
"ekrānu tumšāku vai gaišāku.\n"
"Ņemiet vērā, jo gaišāks ekrāns, jo vairāk enerģijas tas patērē!\n"
"\n"
"Nospiediet spilgtuma palielināšanu vai samazināšanu (V/VI)."

msgid ""
"Now you're ready to start your RETROGAMING experience with Recalbox! Press "
"button B to start... and PLAY AGAIN!"
msgstr ""
"Tagad esat gatavs sākt savu RETROGAMING pieredzi ar Recalbox! Nospiediet "
"pogu B, lai sāktu... un SPĒLĒJIET VĒLREIZ!"

msgid "WELCOME TO RECALBOX!"
msgstr "LAIPNI LŪDZAM RECALBOX!"

msgid ""
"Just a few words about the POWER button.\n"
"Make a short press, just like a mouse click, and your console will enter "
"sleep mode. Make another short press and your console will restart instanly! "
"Work in Recalbox interface and in-game!\n"
"\n"
"Press button B to continue."
msgstr ""
"Tikai daži vārdi par POWER pogu.\n"
"Nospiediet īsi, tāpat kā peles klikšķi, un jūsu konsole pāries miega režīmā. "
"Nospiediet vēlreiz īsi, un konsole nekavējoties restartēsies! Darbojas "
"Recalbox saskarnē un spēlē!\n"
"\n"
"Nospiediet pogu B, lai turpinātu."

msgid ""
"If you push the POWER button more than 2 seconds, this will power-off your "
"console. If you do so in-game, Recalbox will close the current emulator "
"gracefully.\n"
"Just in case, holding the POWER button down more than 5s perform an hard "
"power-off.\n"
"\n"
"Press button B to continue."
msgstr ""
"Ja nospiedīsiet POWER pogu ilgāk par 2 sekundēm, tas izslēgs jūsu konsoli. "
"Ja to darāt spēles laikā, Recalbox korekti aizvērs pašreizējo emulatoru.\n"
"Ja nepieciešams, POWER pogas turēšana ilgāk par 5s veic piespiedu "
"izslēgšanu.\n"
"\n"
"Nospiediet pogu B, lai turpinātu."

msgid ""
"One more thing to know: If you plug in or unplug your headphones in the jack "
"connector, Recalbox will automatically switch the audio output. Convenient.\n"
"\n"
"Press button B, as usual."
msgstr ""
"Vēl viena lieta, ko zināt: ja pievienojat vai atvienojat austiņas ligzdas "
"savienotājā, Recalbox automātiski pārslēgs audio izvadi. Ērti.\n"
"\n"
"Nospiediet pogu B, kā parasti."

