msgid ""
"You can navigate through the menus using the directional pad, **select a "
"system**, or start a game with the **B button**. The **A button** allows you "
"to exit a menu or game list.\n"
"\n"
"Access the **main menu** using the **START button**.\n"
"To exit a game, press the SELECT and START buttons simultaneously."
msgstr ""
"Jūs varat pārvietoties izvēlnēs, izmantojot virziena pogas, **izvēlēties "
"sistēmu** vai sākt spēli ar **B pogu**. **A poga** ļauj iziet no izvēlnes "
"vai spēļu saraksta.\n"
"\n"
"Piekļūstiet **galvenajai izvēlnei**, izmantojot **START pogu**.\n"
"Lai izietu no spēles, nospiediet SELECT un START pogas vienlaicīgi."

msgid "RGB JAMMA 2"
msgstr "RGB JAMMA 2"

msgid ""
"You can navigate through the menus using the joystick, **select a system**, "
"or start a game with the **button 1**. The **button 2** allows you to exit a "
"menu or game list.\n"
"\n"
"Access the **main menu** using the **START button**.\n"
"To **exit a game**, **press and hold START** for 4 seconds and release."
msgstr ""
"Jūs varat pārvietoties izvēlnēs, izmantojot vadības sviru, **izvēlēties "
"sistēmu** vai sākt spēli ar **1. pogu**. **2. poga** ļauj iziet no izvēlnes "
"vai spēļu saraksta.\n"
"\n"
"Piekļūstiet **galvenajai izvēlnei**, izmantojot **START pogu**.\n"
"Lai **izietu no spēles**, **nospiediet un turiet START** 4 sekundes un "
"atlaidiet."

msgid "RGB DUAL 2"
msgstr "RGB DUAL 2"

msgid ""
"Your Recalbox RGB DUAL 2 has been detected and installed automatically! You "
"can now enjoy **all your games** on Recalbox with **perfect pixels and "
"frequency**!"
msgstr ""
"Jūsu Recalbox RGB DUAL 2 ir atrasts un automātiski instalēts! Tagad varat "
"baudīt **visas savas spēles** Recalbox ar **perfektiem pikseļiem un "
"frekvenci**!"

msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Consider this: you can automatically switch back to **HDMI mode** by "
"connecting an HDMI cable and restarting Recalbox!"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Ņemiet vērā: jūs varat automātiski pārslēgties atpakaļ uz **HDMI režīmu**, "
"pievienojot HDMI kabeli un restartējot Recalbox!"

msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"An HDMI cable has been detected and the “HDMI priority” mode is enabled in "
"the options. To switch back to CRT mode, disconnect the HDMI cable and "
"restart, or disable the HDMI priority option in the Recalbox RGB DUAL 2 "
"(START) menu options."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Ir atrasts HDMI kabelis, un opcijās ir ieslēgts “HDMI prioritātes” režīms. "
"Lai pārslēgtos atpakaļ uz CRT režīmu, atvienojiet HDMI kabeli un "
"restartējiet, vai izslēdziet HDMI prioritātes opciju Recalbox RGB DUAL 2 "
"(START) izvēlnes opcijās."

