msgid ""
"Recalbox adds many new features with each new version, which gradually "
"increases the size of the system.\n"
"The system partition on your installation is too small to accommodate "
"version {0}.\n"
"\n"
"To continue receiving updates, you must reinstall Recalbox by downloading "
"the latest image from www.recalbox.com."
msgstr ""
"Recalbox pievieno daudz jaunu funkciju ar katru jaunu versiju, kas "
"pakāpeniski palielina sistēmas izmēru.\n"
"Jūsu instalācijas sistēmas nodalījums ir pārāk mazs, lai akomodētu versiju "
"{0}.\n"
"\n"
"Lai turpinātu saņemt atjauninājumus, jums jāpāradīnstalē Recalbox, "
"lejupielādējot jaunāko attēlu no www.recalbox.com."

msgid ""
